10 REM COMMUNITY GARDEN CO-OP OPERATIONS DASHBOARD
20 REM Forecast harvest, sales, water use, and bed productivity.
30 DIM BED$(6)
40 DIM CROP$(6)
50 DIM AREA(6)
60 DIM PLANTS(6)
70 DIM YIELD_PER_PLANT(6)
80 DIM PRICE_PER_LB(6)
90 DIM WATER_PER_BED(6)
